<section class="page-section approach"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro rv"><span class="eyebrow">Our Approach</span><h2>Understand → Design → Build → Improve</h2></div><div class="approach-flow"><article class="approach-step rv"><span>01</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Start with people, context, requirements and the real problem.</p></article><article class="approach-step rv"><span>02</span><h3>Design</h3><p>Shape the experience, architecture and workflow before implementation.</p></article><article class="approach-step rv"><span>03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Turn the system model into maintainable software and useful interfaces.</p></article><article class="approach-step rv"><span>04</span><h3>Improve</h3><p>Use feedback and learning to make the system more useful over time.</p></article></div><div class="page-cta rv"><a class="btn p" href="/culture">Discover Our Culture</a></div></div></section>